      "writtenOn": "2025-02-18T21:51:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we just have this be a nop and return success? I agree with your idea, but an application isn\u0027t aware of libcutils setting the name. I\u0027m not sure if there are cases where an ashmem buffer is created and named later, which would now fail.",
