      "lineNbr": 621,
      "author": {
        "id": 1892347
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T10:36:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So that would be an application providing a name to libcutils to create the fd, and then renaming it later, but before it is first mapped?",
