      "writtenOn": "2025-02-18T21:51:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is because we\u0027re assuming that `libcutils` sealed the size, so we should return `EPERM`: https://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/e792e182463bdfd1c9c34aab22a1b7e035cbad15:common/mm/shmem.c;l\u003d1211-1214",
